{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-2","show_title":true,"content_width":"md"}},"custom_liquid_Kb3jby":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:sections.custom_liquid.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","liquid":"<style>\n      .senson-lp {\n        width: 100%;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n        background-color: #f8f4ef;\n        font-family: inherit;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n      }\n      .senson-lp * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n      }\n      .senson-lp img {\n        max-width: 100%;\n        display: block;\n      }\n\n      \/* Utilities *\/\n      .text-white {\n        color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      .text-accent {\n        color: #b58f83;\n      }\n      .italic {\n        font-style: italic;\n      }\n      .font-serif {\n        font-family: 'Playfair Display', 'Source Serif Pro', serif;\n        font-weight: normal;\n      }\n\n      \/* Buttons *\/\n      .senson-btn-primary {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        background: linear-gradient(171deg, #e8d2cf 0%, #d8beb8 100%);\n        color: #3e3a36;\n        border-radius: 9999px;\n        padding: 12px 24px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.1s ease; \/* 增加点击动画过渡 *\/\n        cursor: pointer;\n        border: none;\n      }\n      .senson-btn-primary:hover {\n        opacity: 0.9;\n      }\n      .senson-btn-primary:active {\n        opacity: 0.8;\n        transform: scale(0.98); \/* 增加按下的微缩放效果 *\/\n      }\n\n      .senson-btn-outline {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        border: 1px solid #3e3a36;\n        border-radius: 9999px; \/* 使用足够大的值保证全圆角 *\/\n        padding: 12px 24px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        background: transparent;\n        transition: all 0.3s ease, transform 0.1s ease; \/* 增加点击动画过渡 *\/\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      .senson-btn-outline:hover {\n        background: #3e3a36;\n        color: #ffffff;\n      }\n      .senson-btn-outline:active {\n        transform: scale(0.98); \/* 增加按下的微缩放效果 *\/\n      }\n\n      \/* Section 1: Hero *\/\n      .senson-hero {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        aspect-ratio: 375 \/ 600; \/* H5 比例 *\/\n        max-height: 600px; \/* 限制H5最大高度，防止iPad上拉伸太长 *\/\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        justify-content: flex-start;\n        align-items: center;\n        background-color: #000;\n        overflow: hidden;\n      }\n      .senson-hero picture {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n      }\n      .senson-hero-bg {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        object-fit: cover;\n        object-position: center; \/* 确保图片居中裁剪 *\/\n        opacity: 0.8;\n      }\n      .senson-hero-content {\n        position: relative;\n        z-index: 2;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center; \/* H5 内部居中 *\/\n        text-align: center; \/* H5 内部居中 *\/\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        margin-top: 170px; \/* 严格按照 Figma 高度 *\/\n        gap: 16px; \/* 间距调整 *\/\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 343px;\n      }\n      .senson-hero-label {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.88px;\n        text-align: center; \/* 标签居中 *\/\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n      .senson-hero-title {\n        font-size: 32px;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        letter-spacing: -1.8px; \/* 字体间距调整 *\/\n        text-align: center; \/* 标题居中 *\/\n      }\n      .senson-hero-desc {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        font-style: italic;\n        text-align: center; \/* 描述居中 *\/\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n      .senson-hero-content .senson-btn-primary {\n        align-self: center; \/* 按钮居中 *\/\n        white-space: nowrap; \/* 强制按钮文字不换行，保持在一行 *\/\n      }\n\n      \/* Section 2 & 5: Story *\/\n      .senson-story-sec {\n        padding: 40px 16px;\n        background-color: #f8f4ef;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n      }\n      .senson-story-container {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 16px;\n      }\n      .senson-dropcap {\n        float: left;\n        font-size: 60px;\n        line-height: 0.8;\n        margin-right: 8px;\n        margin-top: 4px;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n      }\n      .senson-story-text {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n      }\n      .senson-story-block::after {\n        content: '';\n        display: table;\n        clear: both;\n      }\n      .senson-story-quote {\n        border-left: 2px solid #b58f83;\n        padding-left: 16px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        margin: 8px 0;\n        color: #b58f83;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        font-style: italic;\n      }\n\n      \/* Section 3: Product Intro *\/\n      .senson-prod-sec {\n        padding: 40px 16px;\n        background-color: #f8f4ef;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n      }\n      .senson-prod-container {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 1200px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 24px;\n      }\n      .senson-section-title {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n      }\n      .senson-prod-layout {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 24px;\n      }\n      .senson-prod-visual {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 350px; \/* 固定最大高度，如果父级宽它也不会被无限拉长 *\/\n        max-height: 560px; \/* 增加最大高度限制 *\/\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(62, 58, 54, 0.1);\n        order: 1; \/* H5端图片在上 *\/\n      }\n      .senson-prod-visual picture,\n      .senson-prod-visual img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        object-fit: cover;\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .senson-prod-info {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 16px;\n        order: 2; \/* H5端文字在下 *\/\n      }\n      .senson-prod-info .senson-btn-outline {\n        align-self: center; \/* H5端按钮居中 *\/\n        margin-top: 8px;\n        width: 100%; \/* 占满宽度 *\/\n      }\n\n      \/* Section 4: Safety \/ Features *\/\n      .senson-safety-sec {\n        padding: 40px 16px;\n        background-color: #f6f1eb;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-card {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 1200px;\n        background-color: #f2ece6;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(62, 58, 54, 0.1);\n        padding: 24px 16px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 24px;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-header {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 27px;\n        width: 100%;\n        order: 1;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-text-group {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 16px;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-visual-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        order: 2;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: auto;\n        display: block;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-pills {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 16px;\n        width: 100%;\n        order: 3;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-pills-row {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 16px;\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n      .senson-safety-pill {\n        flex: 1;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        background: rgba(246, 241, 235, 0.9);\n        border: 0.37px solid #3e3a36;\n        border-radius: 9999px;\n        padding: 8px;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        text-align: center;\n        box-shadow: 0px 0.74px 3px rgba(62, 58, 54, 0.08);\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        color: #3e3a36;\n      }\n\n      \/* Section 6: CTA *\/\n      .senson-cta-sec {\n        padding: 40px 16px;\n        background: linear-gradient(\n          126deg,\n          #e8d2cf 0%,\n          #f7e9d7 50%,\n          #f6f1eb 100%\n        );\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n      }\n      .senson-cta-container {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        gap: 16px;\n      }\n\n      \/* PC Media Queries (min-width: 1000px) *\/\n      @media (min-width: 1000px) {\n        .senson-hero {\n          aspect-ratio: 1440 \/ 561; \/* PC 比例 *\/\n          height: auto;\n          align-items: center; \/* pc端居中 *\/\n          justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-bg {\n          object-position: center; \/* 恢复居中 *\/\n          opacity: 1;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-content {\n          max-width: 1200px;\n          margin: 0 auto;\n          width: 100%;\n          align-items: center; \/* PC端设计稿内容整体居中 *\/\n          text-align: center; \/* PC端设计稿内容整体居中 *\/\n          gap: 24px;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-label {\n          text-align: center;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-title {\n          font-size: 64px;\n          max-width: 1000px;\n          letter-spacing: -1.8px;\n          text-align: center;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-desc {\n          font-size: 20px;\n          margin-bottom: 8px;\n          text-align: center;\n        }\n        .senson-hero-content .senson-btn-primary {\n          align-self: center;\n        }\n\n        .senson-story-sec {\n          padding: 60px 120px;\n        }\n        .senson-story-container {\n          gap: 24px;\n        }\n        .senson-dropcap {\n          font-size: 96px;\n          margin-right: 12px;\n        }\n        .senson-story-text {\n          font-size: 18px;\n        }\n        .senson-story-quote {\n          font-size: 22px;\n          padding-left: 26px;\n          margin: 16px 0;\n        }\n\n        .senson-prod-sec {\n          padding: 60px 120px;\n        }\n        .senson-prod-container {\n          gap: 40px;\n        }\n        .senson-section-title {\n          font-size: 34px;\n        }\n        .senson-prod-layout {\n          flex-direction: row;\n          align-items: center;\n          gap: 80px;\n        }\n        .senson-prod-info {\n          flex: 1;\n          gap: 24px;\n          order: 1; \/* PC端文字在左 *\/\n        }\n        .senson-prod-info .senson-btn-outline {\n          align-self: flex-start; \/* PC端按钮靠左 *\/\n          width: auto; \/* 恢复自适应宽度 *\/\n        }\n        .senson-prod-visual {\n          flex: 1;\n          width: auto;\n          height: 560px; \/* PC端设计稿固定高度 *\/\n          aspect-ratio: auto;\n          order: 2; \/* PC端图片在右 *\/\n        }\n        .senson-safety-sec {\n          padding: 60px 120px;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-card {\n          padding: 64px 48px;\n          gap: 64px;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-header {\n          order: 2;\n          width: 100%;\n          max-width: 100%;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-text-group {\n          gap: 24px;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-visual-wrapper {\n          order: 1;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-img {\n          width: 926px;\n          max-width: 100%;\n        }\n        .senson-safety-pills {\n          display: none;\n        }\n\n        .senson-cta-sec {\n          padding: 80px 120px;\n        }\n        .senson-cta-container {\n          gap: 24px;\n        }\n      }\n    <\/style>\n    <div class=\"senson-lp\">\n      <!-- Section 1: Hero -->\n      <div class=\"senson-hero\">\n        <picture>\n          <source\n            media=\"(min-width: 1000px)\"\n            srcset=\"\n              https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/260110_SENSON3013_2_1_1.png?v=1773774056\n            \"\n          \/>\n          <img\n            src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/260110_SENSON3013_2_h5.png?v=1773772939\"\n            alt=\"Senson Hero\"\n            class=\"senson-hero-bg\"\n          \/>\n        <\/picture>\n        <div class=\"senson-hero-content\">\n          <p class=\"senson-hero-label text-white\">My nightly ritual<\/p>\n          <h1 class=\"senson-hero-title font-serif text-white\">\n            This simple self-care ritual changed my nights, my mood, and my\n            energy\n          <\/h1>\n          <p class=\"senson-hero-desc text-white\">\n            Not louder. Not faster. Just softer. And finally, mine.\n          <\/p>\n          <a href=\"\/\" class=\"senson-btn-primary\"\n            >Visit the official SensOn experience →<\/a\n          >\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Story Part 1 -->\n      <div class=\"senson-story-sec\">\n        <div class=\"senson-story-container\">\n          <div class=\"senson-story-block\">\n            <span class=\"senson-dropcap font-serif\">L<\/span>\n            <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n              ast winter, I completely burned out. It was the kind of exhaustion\n              that sleep couldn't fix. December blurred into January. Endless\n              deadlines, late-night screens, constant pressure to \"hold it\n              together.\" Even on weekends, my body stayed tense. My mind never\n              slowed down.\n            <\/p>\n          <\/div>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            I tried everything — yoga, meditation apps, breathwork, and therapy.\n            Some days felt lighter, but at night, the heaviness always returned.\n            What I missed wasn't rest. It was a connection — to my body, my\n            emotions, and myself.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-quote font-serif\">\n            I didn't need more effort. I needed something that genuinely invited\n            me back.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            Then one cold evening, after another restless night, I found\n            something different. Not loud. Not aggressive. Just soft guidance,\n            gentle rhythms, and a sense of safety. For the first time in months,\n            my breathing slowed — and I finally slept deeply. Since then, it's\n            become my nightly ritual: no performance, no expectations — only\n            fantasy, presence, and a quiet return to myself.\n          <\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Product Intro -->\n      <div class=\"senson-prod-sec\">\n        <div class=\"senson-prod-container\">\n          <h2 class=\"senson-section-title font-serif\">\n            How SensOn felt... surprisingly human\n          <\/h2>\n          <div class=\"senson-prod-layout\">\n            <div class=\"senson-prod-info\">\n              <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n                The first time I used it, I was struck by how it seemed to\n                respond to my emotions. The audio adjusted. The movement slowed\n                when I needed space and intensified when I leaned in.\n              <\/p>\n              <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n                It wasn't following a script — it\n                <span class=\"text-accent italic\">created flow<\/span>. Hardware\n                and software blurred into sensation and story. I felt held,\n                guided, invited — never pushed.\n              <\/p>\n              <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n                For the first time in years, I had\n                <span class=\"text-accent italic\"\n                  >a private space built just for me<\/span\n                >.\n              <\/p>\n              <a\n                href=\"\/products\/senson-ai-intimacy-device-v1\"\n                class=\"senson-btn-outline\"\n                >Explore Intelligent Self-Awareness<\/a\n              >\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"senson-prod-visual\">\n              <picture>\n                <source\n                  media=\"(min-width: 1000px)\"\n                  srcset=\"\n                    https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/2_2_1.png?v=1773772939\n                  \"\n                \/>\n                <img\n                  src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/2_2_1_h5.png?v=1773772939\"\n                  alt=\"Product Lifestyle\"\n                \/>\n              <\/picture>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Safety \/ Features -->\n      <div class=\"senson-safety-sec\">\n        <div class=\"senson-safety-card\">\n          <div class=\"senson-safety-header\">\n            <h2 class=\"senson-section-title font-serif\">\n              Safety changed everything\n            <\/h2>\n            <div class=\"senson-safety-text-group\">\n              <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n                I'd used products before that felt cold. Clinical. Sometimes\n                uncomfortable. SensOn was designed differently — with women's\n                bodies, comfort, and autonomy at the center.\n              <\/p>\n              <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n                Every curve, every material choice, every software decision felt\n                intentional. Not engineered for efficiency — engineered for\n                trust. I could pause anytime. Adjust anything. The experience\n                shaped itself around my boundaries, not the other way around.\n              <\/p>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <div class=\"senson-safety-visual-wrapper\">\n            <picture>\n              <source\n                media=\"(min-width: 1000px)\"\n                srcset=\"\n                  https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/Container_1d419228-3672-4f7d-9ab0-dc383eeef3b4.png?v=1774621989\n                \"\n              \/>\n              <img\n                class=\"senson-safety-img\"\n                src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0775\/2446\/7967\/files\/Container_h5.png?v=1774621308\"\n                alt=\"Safety Visual\"\n              \/>\n            <\/picture>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <div class=\"senson-safety-pills\">\n            <div class=\"senson-safety-pills-row\">\n              <div class=\"senson-safety-pill\">User-controlled pacing<\/div>\n              <div class=\"senson-safety-pill\">Soft-touch materials<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"senson-safety-pills-row\">\n              <div class=\"senson-safety-pill\">Quiet engineering<\/div>\n              <div class=\"senson-safety-pill\">Responsive comfort<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"senson-safety-pills-row\">\n              <div class=\"senson-safety-pill\" style=\"width: 100%\">\n                Thoughtful contours\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <!-- Section 5: Story Part 2 -->\n      <div class=\"senson-story-sec\">\n        <div class=\"senson-story-container\">\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            What makes this experience different is the sense of control. I\n            didn't have to follow a preset rhythm — I could shape everything\n            around how I wanted to feel in that moment: the voice, the tone, the\n            pace, and the atmosphere. Each session became a reflection of my\n            mood.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            What surprised me most was how immersive it felt. Intelligent\n            software and responsive hardware blurred the line between\n            imagination and sensation — so instead of distraction, I felt\n            presence. Over time, it became more than self-care. It became a\n            quiet ritual of release, self-discovery, and reconnection — on my\n            own terms.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-quote font-serif\">\n            It's not about trying harder. It's about allowing myself to feel.\n          <\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <!-- Section 6: CTA -->\n      <div class=\"senson-cta-sec\">\n        <div class=\"senson-cta-container\">\n          <h2 class=\"senson-section-title font-serif\">\n            If you've been searching for reconnection...\n          <\/h2>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            If you've felt disconnected from pleasure, pressured by\n            expectations, or stuck in patterns that don't serve you anymore —\n            this is your invitation to try something gentler.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            SensOn isn't about performance. It's about presence. About\n            reclaiming intimacy as something soft, safe, and entirely yours.\n          <\/p>\n          <p class=\"senson-story-text\">\n            The official experience is waiting — full of color, fantasy, and\n            possibility.\n          <\/p>\n          <a\n            href=\"\/products\/senson-ai-intimacy-device-v1\"\n            class=\"senson-btn-primary\"\n            >Visit the official SensOn experience →<\/a\n          >\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>","text_alignment":"left","add_vertical_spacing":false,"add_horizontal_spacing":false}}},"order":["main","custom_liquid_Kb3jby"]}